Title: The Demo
Author: Draftling

INT. KITCHEN - NIGHT

A small writing device glows on the table. MAYA (30s) stares at it.

MAYA
(whispering)
No notifications. No tabs. Just words.

She types. The screen keeps up.

CUT TO:

EXT. ROOFTOP - DAWN

Maya reads the finished page aloud to the city.

MAYA
It was all here the whole time.

> THE END <
